1
00:00:07,207 --> 00:00:07,907
Ethan@Your room is very girly.

2
00:00:09,976 --> 00:00:10,610
Emily@What are you talking about?

3
00:00:12,779 --> 00:00:13,546
Ethan@Well... it smells nice.

4
00:00:18,251 --> 00:00:19,285
Ethan@You're reading books too?

5
00:00:21,287 --> 00:00:21,955
Emily@Yes, I am.

6
00:00:22,989 --> 00:00:24,391
Ethan@I really like the author of this book.

7
00:00:25,892 --> 00:00:26,960
Emily@I know.

8
00:00:27,627 --> 00:00:28,128
Ethan@You know?

9
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:33,800
Ethan@What other books do you read?

10
00:00:35,468 --> 00:00:35,935
Ethan@What's wrong?

11
00:00:37,937 --> 00:00:39,606
Emily@Nothing.

12
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:42,976
Ethan@You keep a handwritten diary?

13
00:00:43,676 --> 00:00:45,879
Ethan@Aren't many people forgetting how to write characters these days?

14
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:46,579
Emily@Yeah, that's true.

15
00:00:46,579 --> 00:00:47,213
Ethan@Let me take a look.

16
00:00:48,181 --> 00:00:49,716
Emily@We don't need this for now.

17
00:00:50,283 --> 00:00:52,318
Emily@It's just some usual habits.

18
00:00:54,087 --> 00:00:54,854
Ethan@How mysterious.

19
00:01:00,994 --> 00:01:01,761
Ethan@So...

20
00:01:01,761 --> 00:01:02,762
Ethan@So, what are you going to do later?

21
00:01:03,530 --> 00:01:04,464
Emily@Later... I don't have any plans.

22
00:01:07,534 --> 00:01:08,101
Ethan@Then...

23
00:01:08,101 --> 00:01:09,135
Ethan@How about we go for afternoon tea or something like that?

24
00:01:14,307 --> 00:01:15,008
Emily@Sure, that sounds good.

25
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:18,278
Ethan@What flavor of cake do you like?

26
00:01:21,748 --> 00:01:22,649
Ethan@What's that?

27
00:01:27,921 --> 00:01:29,122
Emily@Ethan...

28
00:01:29,889 --> 00:01:31,157
Emily@That's not okay.

29
00:01:58,017 --> 00:01:58,318
Ethan@A-Actually...

30
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,421
Ethan@I also... ...

31
00:02:03,189 --> 00:02:03,556
Ethan@No, that's not right.

32
00:02:04,257 --> 00:02:05,258
Ethan@I, I, I wasn't sure before.

33
00:02:08,361 --> 00:02:08,862
Ethan@Do, do you like me too?

34
00:02:13,533 --> 00:02:14,601
Ethan@Anyway, thank you.

35
00:02:14,901 --> 00:02:16,002
Ethan@Thank you for liking me too.

36
00:02:22,909 --> 00:02:23,676
Ethan@I think it's about time.

37
00:02:25,745 --> 00:02:25,945
Ethan@I, I should go now.

38
00:02:28,348 --> 00:02:29,649
Ethan@Let's meet again next time.

39
00:02:30,583 --> 00:02:31,284
Emily@Wait a moment.

40
00:02:37,157 --> 00:02:39,425
Emily@Can you stay with me a little longer?

41
00:03:44,424 --> 00:03:44,958
Emily@Is that okay?

